OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally cloudy to start
OL,6,FSunday with the odd spot of rain
OL,7,Fpossible. Turning brighter through the
OL,8,Fafternoon with more sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,10,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud increasing overnight,
OL,13,Fperhaps with a few outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fand drizzle. A rather mild night with
OL,15,Flight westerly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA cloudy Monday with isolated
OL,18,Fspots of light patchy rain possible.
OL,19,FTurning drier later. Still very warm,
OL,20,Fthough not feeling as hot as recent
OL,21,Fdays.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
